-  never reruns a task. `hc keep <t> --off` disables recovery. Signal death
+  without rerunning a task. An integration can supply an explicit one-shot
+  replacement with `hc keep <t> --resume '{"key":"conversation","cwd":"/project","argv":["agent","--resume","id"]}'`.
